    <div>
      <h2 id="praveen-heading">Shri Praveen Radhakrishnan &mdash; the teacher and kaliputra today</h2>
      <p>
        Shri Praveen Radhakrishnan is the disciple of Gurubaba Shyama Khyapa and
        the teacher through whom this lineage has become known to a new
        generation of seekers. He is also the compiler&rsquo;s Guru and the
        founder and guide of the Kaliputra Mission. The articles in this archive
        are transcriptions of spoken teachings; many of them are his accounts of
        the lineage.
      </p>
      <p>
        His teaching begins from ordinary life. After thirteen years of personal
        sadhana, he began sharing freely what he had received: talks and
        writing, sadhana guidance around amavasya, satsangs, and service. The
        Kaliputra Mission grew around that sharing &mdash; annadanam, care for
        animals, and guidance offered without charge. The conviction is simple:
        one does not have to leave one&rsquo;s duties to walk toward the Divine.
        A householder can keep Ma Kali&rsquo;s name in the heart, serve what life
        puts in front of him, and meet Her there.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

